    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reticent Retribution is a top down twin stick shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 3rd person action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must blast waves of space enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use the keyboard and a controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have 8 way movement and 8 way aiming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three enemy types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are random maps with terrain to block movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">720p 60fps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press 'esc' to quit, 'h' for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
